      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-a/q5-solution-1.svg\" alt=\"C 6 P θ Q R l Let θ = ∠PCQ. The arc-length formula is l = rθ, with θ in radians:\" style=\"--madas-width:402.7px\"></figure>",
