      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-a/q5-solution-3.svg\" alt=\"√ . = 6 3 [A1] tangent length The area of the triangle is 1 2|CP| |PR| [A1] triangle area formula , so √ area of CPR = 1 2(6)(6 3) √ 3 cm2. = 18 [A1] triangle area The sector formula is A = 1 2r2θ. [A1] sector area formula Thus area of sector CPQ = 1 2(62)(π/3) .\" style=\"--madas-width:445.3px\"></figure>",
